  "credit": "Ali Romman PR5829 whole-high geometry and PR5814 generic allocation; David Arias PR2776 exact seven-symbol assembler/counter; original notices retained. New source-bound physical table and composition: thu-nmrc with substantial OpenAI Codex and parallel-agent assistance. Shape grant glue reuses existing binary-counter arithmetic and retains Jose Manuel selected-binary-control and R437 quotient/descriptor predecessors; only its source-bound emitted ABI/link and one-edge replacement are new. The same-publication successor emits fixed-width all-depth on-path child production and natural-root A/R/H setup/cleanup; generic arithmetic and geometric sums retain predecessor credit.",
